  "id": "disconnect-reconnect-replay",
  "title": "Connection drops mid-stream; client reconnects with Last-Event-ID",
  "description": "Every SSE frame carries `id: <n>` (harness extension; AG-UI 1.0 defines no resume transport). On the first attempt the server destroys the socket after 25 frames. The client must re-POST the same RunAgentInput with header `Last-Event-ID: <last id seen>` (or `?lastEventId=`); the server replays from the next frame. The final text must equal the original exactly: no duplicated or lost deltas.",
  "tags": [
    "@reconnect",
    "@replay"
  ],
  "userPrompt": "Give me the decisions again, please.",
